<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal Aug prod price index rises 3.1 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Portugal Aug prod price index rises 3.1 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal's producer price index rose 3.1 percent year-on-year in August and was up 0.3 percent month-on-month, the National Statistics Institute (INE) said.  </p>
<p>					Aug 96     July 96	Aug 95</p>
<p>General Index		     120.6	 120.3	 117.0</p>
<p>Percentage change yr/yr	  3.1	   3.4	    -</p>
<p>Percentage change mo/mo	  0.3	  -0.3	    -</p>
<p>Accumulated 12 months	    3.1	   3.1	    -</p>
<p>Base Year = 1990</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
</text>
